    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "7b1457af-7cef-44e9-9a0a-53b7cef43fe0",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Accidental Orchestration",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NEWZEALAND",
        "PublicId": "120464340730",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/sheep/scene_sheep.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 293579a3-b1d9-415a-ad3f-9f876892d9b1).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings, 47.\r\rHigh Level Analysts at the ICA are investigating various new methods to train new agents in the field. They have contracted us to demonstrate the various ways we eliminate targets... unsuspicously.\r\rI have taken the liberty of selecting 5 targets in New Zealand that fit this description. while it may seem daunting at first glance, I have faith in you.\r\rDo what you do best.\r\r[PUZZLE - Recommended Loadout: Sieker, Breaching Charge, Proximity Taser, Lethal Syringe. Peekabo optional}",
